    {
      "path": "src/race-hot.asm",
      "name": "race-hot.asm",
      "kind": "source",
      "source": "; Trike Mania measured hot-path renderer and HUD writer.\n; Profile before replacement: sprite rendering 15,638 cycles and full HUD 247,399 cycles.\n; This routine owns only $e0-$e8, reserved by the project compiler configuration.\n\nHOT_ACTOR = $e0\nHOT_WORD = $e1\nHOT_X_LOW = $e2\nHOT_X_HIGH = $e3\nHOT_Y = $e4\nHOT_JUMP = $e5\nHOT_X_MSB = $e6\nHOT_POSITION = $e7\nHOT_PROGRESS = $e8\nHOT_JOY = $e9\nHOT_MAP_LO = $ea\nHOT_MAP_HI = $eb\nHOT_NEXT_X_LO = $ec\nHOT_NEXT_X_HI = $ed\nHOT_NEXT_Y_LO = $ee\nHOT_NEXT_Y_HI = $ef\nHOT_DELTA = $f0\nHOT_MATERIAL = $f1\nHOT_TARGET = $f2\nHOT_DESIRED = $f3\n\n; Profiled fused update for the fixed four-racer championship. The generic C\n; composition measured 79,491 cycles. This preserves the Game Runtime data\n; contracts while removing call/stack materialization from the frame loop.\n_trike_update_race_hot:\n    lda _trike_frame_joy\n    sta HOT_JOY\n    lda _trike_current_track\n    beq trike_update_map_teddy_park\n    cmp #$01\n    beq trike_update_map_picnic\n    lda #<toybox_turbo_material\n    sta HOT_MAP_LO\n    lda #>toybox_turbo_material\n    bne trike_update_map_ready\ntrike_update_map_teddy_park:\n    lda #<teddy_park_material\n    sta HOT_MAP_LO\n    lda #>teddy_park_material\n    bne trike_update_map_ready\ntrike_update_map_picnic:\n    lda #<picnic_panic_material\n    sta HOT_MAP_LO\n    lda #>picnic_panic_material\ntrike_update_map_ready:\n    sta HOT_MAP_HI\n    lda #$00\n    sta HOT_ACTOR\ntrike_update_actor_loop:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_finished,x\n    beq trike_update_actor_active\n    jmp trike_update_actor_next\ntrike_update_actor_active:\n    cpx #$00\n    bne trike_update_ai_steer\n    lda _trike_autopilot_player\n    bne trike_update_ai_steer\n    jmp trike_update_player_steer\n\n; AI selects one of eight headings from the next checkpoint cell.\ntrike_update_ai_steer:\n    lda _racer_turn_delay,x\n    beq trike_update_ai_target\n    sec\n    sbc #$01\n    sta _racer_turn_delay,x\n    jmp trike_update_after_steer\ntrike_update_ai_target:\n    lda _trike_current_track\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    clc\n    adc _racer_waypoint,x\n    sta HOT_TARGET\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    sty HOT_WORD\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_cell_x,y\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    cmp _racer_x+1,y\n    bne trike_update_ai_x_differs\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_cell_y,y\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    cmp _racer_y+1,y\n    bcc trike_update_ai_wants_up\n    lda #$04\n    bne trike_update_ai_desired_ready\ntrike_update_ai_wants_up:\n    lda #$00\n    beq trike_update_ai_desired_ready\ntrike_update_ai_x_differs:\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_cell_y,y\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    cmp _racer_y+1,y\n    beq trike_update_ai_horizontal\n    bcc trike_update_ai_upper\n    lda HOT_X_LOW\n    cmp _racer_x+1,y\n    bcc trike_update_ai_lower_left\n    lda #$03\n    bne trike_update_ai_desired_ready\ntrike_update_ai_lower_left:\n    lda #$05\n    bne trike_update_ai_desired_ready\ntrike_update_ai_upper:\n    lda HOT_X_LOW\n    cmp _racer_x+1,y\n    bcc trike_update_ai_upper_left\n    lda #$01\n    bne trike_update_ai_desired_ready\ntrike_update_ai_upper_left:\n    lda #$07\n    bne trike_update_ai_desired_ready\ntrike_update_ai_horizontal:\n    lda HOT_X_LOW\n    cmp _racer_x+1,y\n    bcc trike_update_ai_wants_left\n    lda #$02\n    bne trike_update_ai_desired_ready\ntrike_update_ai_wants_left:\n    lda #$06\ntrike_update_ai_desired_ready:\n    sta HOT_DESIRED\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    cmp _racer_facing,x\n    beq trike_update_after_steer\n    sec\n    sbc _racer_facing,x\n    and #$07\n    cmp #$05\n    bcs trike_update_ai_turn_left\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    clc\n    adc #$01\n    and #$07\n    sta _racer_facing,x\n    jmp trike_update_ai_turn_delay\ntrike_update_ai_turn_left:\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    clc\n    adc #$07\n    and #$07\n    sta _racer_facing,x\ntrike_update_ai_turn_delay:\n    lda _racer_teddy,x\n    tay\n    lda #$08\n    sec\n    sbc _teddy_steering,y\n    sta _racer_turn_delay,x\n    jmp trike_update_after_steer\n\n; Player steering is active-low joystick port 2 input.\ntrike_update_player_steer:\n    lda _racer_spin\n    bne trike_update_after_steer\n    lda _racer_turn_delay\n    beq trike_update_player_read\n    sec\n    sbc #$01\n    sta _racer_turn_delay\n    jmp trike_update_after_steer\ntrike_update_player_read:\n    lda HOT_JOY\n    and #$04\n    bne trike_update_player_right\n    lda _racer_facing\n    clc\n    adc #$07\n    and #$07\n    sta _racer_facing\n    jmp trike_update_player_delay\ntrike_update_player_right:\n    lda HOT_JOY\n    and #$08\n    bne trike_update_after_steer\n    lda _racer_facing\n    clc\n    adc #$01\n    and #$07\n    sta _racer_facing\ntrike_update_player_delay:\n    ldy _racer_teddy\n    lda #$0e\n    sec\n    sbc _teddy_steering,y\n    sta _racer_turn_delay\n\ntrike_update_after_steer:\n    jsr trike_hot_read_current_material\n    jsr trike_hot_update_speed\n    jsr trike_hot_move\n    jsr trike_hot_tick_effects\n    jsr trike_hot_checkpoint\n    jsr trike_hot_animation_frame\ntrike_update_actor_next:\n    inc HOT_ACTOR\n    lda HOT_ACTOR\n    cmp #$04\n    beq trike_update_actors_done\n    jmp trike_update_actor_loop\ntrike_update_actors_done:\n    inc _animation_clock\n    inc _race_frames\n    bne trike_update_timeout_check\n    inc _race_frames+1\ntrike_update_timeout_check:\n    lda _race_frames+1\n    cmp #$0e\n    bcc trike_update_done\n    bne trike_update_timeout\n    lda _race_frames\n    cmp #$11\n    bcc trike_update_done\ntrike_update_timeout:\n    lda #$01\n    sta _trike_timeout_used\n    lda #$00\n    sta HOT_ACTOR\ntrike_update_timeout_loop:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    jsr trike_hot_finish_racer\n    inc HOT_ACTOR\n    lda HOT_ACTOR\n    cmp #$04\n    bne trike_update_timeout_loop\ntrike_update_done:\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_read_current_material:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    lda _racer_x+1,y\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    lda _racer_y+1,y\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    jmp trike_hot_read_candidate_material\n\ntrike_hot_read_candidate_material:\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    asl\n    asl\n    sta HOT_Y\n    asl\n    asl\n    clc\n    adc HOT_Y\n    clc\n    adc HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    tay\n    lda (HOT_MAP_LO),y\n    sta HOT_MATERIAL\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_update_speed:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_teddy,x\n    tay\n    lda HOT_MATERIAL\n    cmp #$01\n    bne trike_hot_speed_road_max\n    lda _teddy_grass_speed,y\n    bne trike_hot_speed_max_ready\ntrike_hot_speed_road_max:\n    lda _teddy_max_speed,y\ntrike_hot_speed_max_ready:\n    sta HOT_X_HIGH\n    ldy _trike_current_track\n    lda HOT_X_HIGH\n    clc\n    adc _track_speed_bonus,y\n    sta HOT_X_HIGH\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    beq trike_hot_speed_boost_check\n    ldy _trike_current_track\n    lda HOT_X_HIGH\n    clc\n    adc _track_ai_bonus,y\n    sta HOT_X_HIGH\ntrike_hot_speed_boost_check:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_boost,x\n    beq trike_hot_speed_select_intent\n    lda HOT_X_HIGH\n    clc\n    adc #$05\n    sta HOT_X_HIGH\ntrike_hot_speed_select_intent:\n    cpx #$00\n    bne trike_hot_speed_pedal\n    lda _trike_autopilot_player\n    bne trike_hot_speed_pedal\n    lda HOT_JOY\n    and #$01\n    beq trike_hot_speed_pedal\n    lda HOT_JOY\n    and #$10\n    beq trike_hot_speed_pedal\n    lda HOT_MATERIAL\n    cmp #$01\n    beq trike_hot_speed_grass_coast\n    lda #$01\n    bne trike_hot_speed_brake_ready\ntrike_hot_speed_grass_coast:\n    lda #$03\ntrike_hot_speed_brake_ready:\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    lda HOT_JOY\n    and #$02\n    bne trike_hot_speed_coast\n    lda HOT_X_LOW\n    asl\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\ntrike_hot_speed_coast:\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    lda _racer_vx,y\n    cmp HOT_X_LOW\n    bcc trike_hot_speed_zero\n    sec\n    sbc HOT_X_LOW\n    bcs trike_hot_speed_store\ntrike_hot_speed_zero:\n    lda #$00\n    beq trike_hot_speed_store\ntrike_hot_speed_pedal:\n    lda _racer_teddy,x\n    tay\n    lda _teddy_accel_step,y\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    lda _racer_vx,y\n    clc\n    adc HOT_X_LOW\n    cmp HOT_X_HIGH\n    bcc trike_hot_speed_store\n    lda HOT_X_HIGH\ntrike_hot_speed_store:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    pha\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    pla\n    sta _racer_vx,y\n    lda #$00\n    sta _racer_vx+1,y\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_move:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    sty HOT_WORD\n    lda _racer_x,y\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    lda _racer_x+1,y\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    lda _racer_y,y\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    lda _racer_y+1,y\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    lda _racer_vx,y\n    sta HOT_DELTA\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    and #$01\n    beq trike_hot_delta_ready\n    lda HOT_DELTA\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    lda HOT_DELTA\n    sec\n    sbc HOT_X_LOW\n    sta HOT_DELTA\ntrike_hot_delta_ready:\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    cmp #$00\n    beq trike_hot_move_up\n    cmp #$01\n    beq trike_hot_move_up_right\n    cmp #$02\n    beq trike_hot_move_right\n    cmp #$03\n    beq trike_hot_move_down_right\n    cmp #$04\n    beq trike_hot_move_down\n    cmp #$05\n    beq trike_hot_move_down_left\n    cmp #$06\n    beq trike_hot_move_left\n    jsr trike_hot_sub_x\n    jsr trike_hot_sub_y\n    jmp trike_hot_move_clamp\ntrike_hot_move_up:\n    jsr trike_hot_sub_y\n    jmp trike_hot_move_clamp\ntrike_hot_move_up_right:\n    jsr trike_hot_add_x\n    jsr trike_hot_sub_y\n    jmp trike_hot_move_clamp\ntrike_hot_move_right:\n    jsr trike_hot_add_x\n    jmp trike_hot_move_clamp\ntrike_hot_move_down_right:\n    jsr trike_hot_add_x\n    jsr trike_hot_add_y\n    jmp trike_hot_move_clamp\ntrike_hot_move_down:\n    jsr trike_hot_add_y\n    jmp trike_hot_move_clamp\ntrike_hot_move_down_left:\n    jsr trike_hot_sub_x\n    jsr trike_hot_add_y\n    jmp trike_hot_move_clamp\ntrike_hot_move_left:\n    jsr trike_hot_sub_x\ntrike_hot_move_clamp:\n    jsr trike_hot_clamp_x\n    jsr trike_hot_clamp_y\n    jsr trike_hot_read_candidate_material\n    lda HOT_MATERIAL\n    cmp #$05\n    bne trike_hot_commit_move\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda _racer_vx,y\n    lsr\n    sta _racer_vx,y\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    clc\n    adc #$04\n    and #$07\n    sta _racer_facing,x\n    ; TODO SFX: play soft barrier bump.\n    rts\ntrike_hot_commit_move:\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    sta _racer_x,y\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    sta _racer_x+1,y\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    sta _racer_y,y\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    sta _racer_y+1,y\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda HOT_MATERIAL\n    cmp _racer_last_material,x\n    beq trike_hot_move_done\n    sta _racer_last_material,x\n    cmp #$02\n    beq trike_hot_trigger_boost\n    cmp #$03\n    beq trike_hot_trigger_ramp\n    cmp #$04\n    beq trike_hot_trigger_oil\ntrike_hot_move_done:\n    rts\ntrike_hot_trigger_boost:\n    ; TODO SFX: play honey-boost pickup whoosh.\n    lda #30\n    sta _racer_boost,x\n    lda _trike_test_events\n    ora #$01\n    sta _trike_test_events\n    rts\ntrike_hot_trigger_ramp:\n    ; TODO SFX: play tricycle ramp launch.\n    lda #28\n    sta _racer_jump,x\n    lda _trike_test_events\n    ora #$02\n    sta _trike_test_events\n    rts\ntrike_hot_trigger_oil:\n    ; TODO SFX: play oil-spin wobble.\n    lda _racer_teddy,x\n    tay\n    lda #24\n    sec\n    sbc _teddy_grip,y\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    sta _racer_spin,x\n    lda _trike_test_events\n    ora #$04\n    sta _trike_test_events\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_add_x:\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    clc\n    adc HOT_DELTA\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    adc #$00\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    rts\ntrike_hot_sub_x:\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    sec\n    sbc HOT_DELTA\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    sbc #$00\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    rts\ntrike_hot_add_y:\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    clc\n    adc HOT_DELTA\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    adc #$00\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    rts\ntrike_hot_sub_y:\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    sec\n    sbc HOT_DELTA\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    sbc #$00\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_clamp_x:\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    bmi trike_hot_clamp_x_min\n    bne trike_hot_clamp_x_max_check\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    cmp #$c0\n    bcs trike_hot_clamp_x_done\ntrike_hot_clamp_x_min:\n    lda #$c0\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    lda #$00\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_HI\n    rts\ntrike_hot_clamp_x_max_check:\n    cmp #$13\n    bcc trike_hot_clamp_x_done\n    bne trike_hot_clamp_x_max\n    lda HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    cmp #$31\n    bcc trike_hot_clamp_x_done\ntrike_hot_clamp_x_max:\n    lda #$30\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_LO\n    lda #$13\n    sta HOT_NEXT_X_HI\ntrike_hot_clamp_x_done:\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_clamp_y:\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    bmi trike_hot_clamp_y_min\n    bne trike_hot_clamp_y_max_check\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    cmp #$c0\n    bcs trike_hot_clamp_y_done\ntrike_hot_clamp_y_min:\n    lda #$c0\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    lda #$00\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\n    rts\ntrike_hot_clamp_y_max_check:\n    cmp #$09\n    bcc trike_hot_clamp_y_done\n    bne trike_hot_clamp_y_max\n    lda HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    cmp #$31\n    bcc trike_hot_clamp_y_done\ntrike_hot_clamp_y_max:\n    lda #$30\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_LO\n    lda #$09\n    sta HOT_NEXT_Y_HI\ntrike_hot_clamp_y_done:\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_tick_effects:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_boost,x\n    beq trike_hot_tick_jump\n    sec\n    sbc #$01\n    sta _racer_boost,x\ntrike_hot_tick_jump:\n    lda _racer_jump,x\n    beq trike_hot_tick_spin\n    sec\n    sbc #$01\n    sta _racer_jump,x\ntrike_hot_tick_spin:\n    lda _racer_spin,x\n    beq trike_hot_tick_done\n    sec\n    sbc #$01\n    sta _racer_spin,x\n    and #$01\n    bne trike_hot_tick_done\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    clc\n    adc #$01\n    and #$07\n    sta _racer_facing,x\ntrike_hot_tick_done:\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_checkpoint:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _trike_current_track\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    clc\n    adc _racer_waypoint,x\n    sta HOT_TARGET\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    sty HOT_WORD\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_gate_axis,y\n    bne trike_hot_checkpoint_vertical_gate\n\n; Horizontal approach: the racer must cross this X column, but any of the\n; three road lanes (checkpoint Y - 1 through checkpoint Y + 1) are valid.\ntrike_hot_checkpoint_horizontal_gate:\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_cell_x,y\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda _racer_x+1,y\n    cmp HOT_X_LOW\n    beq trike_hot_checkpoint_horizontal_x_ok\n    jmp trike_hot_checkpoint_done\ntrike_hot_checkpoint_horizontal_x_ok:\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_cell_y,y\n    sta HOT_Y\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda _racer_y+1,y\n    sec\n    sbc HOT_Y\n    clc\n    adc #$01\n    cmp #$03\n    bcc trike_hot_checkpoint_hit\n    jmp trike_hot_checkpoint_done\n\n; Vertical approach: the racer must cross this Y row, but any of the three\n; road lanes (checkpoint X - 1 through checkpoint X + 1) are valid.\ntrike_hot_checkpoint_vertical_gate:\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_cell_y,y\n    sta HOT_Y\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda _racer_y+1,y\n    cmp HOT_Y\n    beq trike_hot_checkpoint_vertical_y_ok\n    jmp trike_hot_checkpoint_done\ntrike_hot_checkpoint_vertical_y_ok:\n    ldy HOT_TARGET\n    lda _waypoint_cell_x,y\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda _racer_x+1,y\n    sec\n    sbc HOT_X_LOW\n    clc\n    adc #$01\n    cmp #$03\n    bcc trike_hot_checkpoint_hit\n    jmp trike_hot_checkpoint_done\n\ntrike_hot_checkpoint_hit:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_waypoint,x\n    beq trike_hot_new_lap\n    clc\n    adc #$01\n    cmp #16\n    bcc trike_hot_store_waypoint\n    lda #$00\ntrike_hot_store_waypoint:\n    sta _racer_waypoint,x\ntrike_hot_checkpoint_done:\n    rts\n\n_trike_test_checkpoint_hot:\n    lda #$00\n    sta HOT_ACTOR\n    jsr trike_hot_checkpoint\n    rts\ntrike_hot_new_lap:\n    ; TODO SFX: play completed-lap bell for the player.\n    inc _racer_lap,x\n    lda #$01\n    sta _racer_waypoint,x\n    lda _racer_lap,x\n    cmp #$03\n    bcc trike_hot_checkpoint_done\n    jsr trike_hot_finish_racer\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_finish_racer:\n    ; TODO SFX: play player finish-line fanfare when HOT_ACTOR is zero.\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_finished,x\n    bne trike_hot_finish_done\n    lda #$01\n    sta _racer_finished,x\n    txa\n    asl\n    tay\n    lda #$00\n    sta _racer_vx,y\n    sta _racer_vx+1,y\n    ldy _trike_finish_count\n    txa\n    sta _finish_order,y\n    inc _trike_finish_count\n    lda _trike_finish_count\n    cmp #$04\n    bne trike_hot_finish_done\n    lda #$01\n    sta _trike_race_complete\ntrike_hot_finish_done:\n    rts\n\ntrike_hot_animation_frame:\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    asl\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    lda _animation_clock\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    and #$01\n    ora HOT_X_LOW\n    sta _racer_frame,x\n    rts\n\n_trike_render_racers_hot:\n    lda #$00\n    sta HOT_ACTOR\n    sta HOT_X_MSB\ntrike_render_actor_loop:\n    lda HOT_ACTOR\n    asl\n    tay\n    sty HOT_WORD\n\n    lda _racer_x+1,y\n    sta HOT_X_HIGH\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    lda _racer_x,y\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    ora HOT_X_LOW\n    clc\n    adc #12\n    sta HOT_X_LOW\n    php\n    lda HOT_X_HIGH\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    plp\n    adc #$00\n    and #$01\n    sta HOT_X_HIGH\n\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda _racer_y+1,y\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    sta HOT_Y\n    lda _racer_y,y\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    ora HOT_Y\n    clc\n    adc #80\n    sta HOT_Y\n\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda HOT_X_LOW\n    sta $d000,y\n    sta $d008,y\n    lda HOT_Y\n    clc\n    adc #5\n    sta $d009,y\n\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_jump,x\n    beq trike_render_no_jump\n    eor #$ff\n    clc\n    adc #29\n    tay\n    lda _jump_arc,y\n    sta HOT_JUMP\n    lda _racer_facing,x\n    clc\n    adc #16\n    jmp trike_render_frame_ready\ntrike_render_no_jump:\n    lda #$00\n    sta HOT_JUMP\n    lda _racer_spin,x\n    beq trike_render_pedal_frame\n    lsr\n    and #$03\n    clc\n    adc #24\n    jmp trike_render_frame_ready\ntrike_render_pedal_frame:\n    lda _racer_frame,x\ntrike_render_frame_ready:\n    clc\n    adc #$90\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    sta $07f8,x\n    lda #$ac\n    sta $07fc,x\n\n    ldy HOT_WORD\n    lda HOT_Y\n    sec\n    sbc HOT_JUMP\n    sta $d001,y\n\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda _racer_teddy,x\n    tay\n    lda _teddy_color,y\n    sta $d027,x\n    lda #11\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    sta $d02b,x\n\n    lda HOT_X_HIGH\n    beq trike_render_no_msb\n    ldx HOT_ACTOR\n    lda trike_x_msb_pair,x\n    ora HOT_X_MSB\n    sta HOT_X_MSB\ntrike_render_no_msb:\n    inc HOT_ACTOR\n    lda HOT_ACTOR\n    cmp #4\n    beq trike_render_actor_done\n    jmp trike_render_actor_loop\ntrike_render_actor_done:\n\n    lda HOT_X_MSB\n    sta $d010\n    lda #$ff\n    sta $d015\n    sta $d01c\n    lda #$f0\n    sta $d01b\n    lda #$00\n    sta $d017\n    sta $d01d\n    rts\n\ntrike_x_msb_pair:\n    .byte $11,$22,$44,$88\n\n_trike_render_hud_hot:\n    lda _racer_lap\n    clc\n    adc #1\n    cmp #4\n    bcc trike_hud_lap_ready\n    lda #3\ntrike_hud_lap_ready:\n    clc\n    adc #48\n    sta $0411\n\n    lda _racer_lap\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    clc\n    adc _racer_waypoint\n    sta HOT_PROGRESS\n    lda #1\n    sta HOT_POSITION\n    ldx #1\ntrike_hud_position_loop:\n    lda _racer_lap,x\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    asl\n    clc\n    adc _racer_waypoint,x\n    cmp HOT_PROGRESS\n    bcc trike_hud_position_next\n    beq trike_hud_position_next\n    inc HOT_POSITION\ntrike_hud_position_next:\n    inx\n    cpx #4\n    bne trike_hud_position_loop\n    lda HOT_POSITION\n    clc\n    adc #48\n    sta $041b\n\n    lda _racer_vx\n    lsr\n    lsr\n    sta HOT_WORD\n    ldx #0\ntrike_hud_speed_loop:\n    cpx HOT_WORD\n    bcc trike_hud_speed_full\n    lda #32\n    bne trike_hud_speed_store\ntrike_hud_speed_full:\n    lda #63\ntrike_hud_speed_store:\n    sta $0436,x\n    lda #2\n    sta $d836,x\n    inx\n    cpx #8\n    bne trike_hud_speed_loop\n\n    lda #18\n    sta $0440\n    lda #1\n    sta $0441\n    lda #3\n    sta $0442\n    lda #9\n    sta $0443\n    lda #14\n    sta $0444\n    lda #7\n    sta $0445\n    ldy #5\n    ldx _racer_spin\n    bne trike_hud_status_spin\n    ldx _racer_jump\n    bne trike_hud_status_jump\n    ldx _racer_boost\n    beq trike_hud_status_color\n    lda #2\n    sta $0440\n    lda #15\n    sta $0441\n    sta $0442\n    lda #19\n    sta $0443\n    lda #20\n    sta $0444\n    lda #32\n    sta $0445\n    ldy #7\n    bne trike_hud_status_color\ntrike_hud_status_jump:\n    lda #1\n    sta $0440\n    lda #9\n    sta $0441\n    lda #18\n    sta $0442\n    lda #32\n    sta $0443\n    sta $0444\n    sta $0445\n    ldy #3\n    bne trike_hud_status_color\ntrike_hud_status_spin:\n    lda #19\n    sta $0440\n    lda #16\n    sta $0441\n    lda #9\n    sta $0442\n    lda #14\n    sta $0443\n    lda #32\n    sta $0444\n    sta $0445\n    ldy #2\ntrike_hud_status_color:\n    tya\n    ldx #0\ntrike_hud_status_color_loop:\n    sta $d840,x\n    inx\n    cpx #6\n    bne trike_hud_status_color_loop\n    rts\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "name": "README.md",
      "kind": "source",
      "source": "# Trike Mania\n\nTrike Mania is a complete four-racer Commodore 64 championship created for Web64 IDE. Teddy bears race tricycles around three editable multicolor circuits, with distinct driver statistics, AI rivals, honey boosts, ramps, oil hazards, barriers, three-lap races, results, championship points, and replay.\n\n## Controls\n\n- Joystick port 2\n- Left/right: steer\n- Up or fire: pedal\n- Down: brake\n- Fire: confirm menus\n\n## Championship\n\n1. Teddy Park - broad garden bends, a honey boost, a dithered bridge ramp, mud, hay bales, flowers, and a duck pond\n2. Picnic Panic - a technical crossing route with jam boosts, basket ramps, spilled jelly, picnic tables, lemonade, and sandwich landmarks\n3. Toybox Turbo - the sharp final circuit with rocket boosts, launch ramps, spinning tops, block walls, trains, and construction chicanes\n\nChoose Bramble the Trailblazer, Coco the Tactician, Patches the Steady Ace, or Tumbles the Daredevil. Each has an individual portrait, face, accessory, race color, and meaningfully different speed, acceleration, steering, and grip. All four teddies compete in every race.\n\n## Editable native assets\n\n- `assets/chars/trike-mania.w64chr`: custom HUD font and multicolor track charset\n- `assets/blocks/*.w64blk`: three separate editable 2x2 themed block vocabularies with curved road edges and dithered ramps\n- `assets/maps/*.w64map`: three editable track maps with material planes\n- `assets/sprites/teddy-trikes.w64spr`: 33 multicolor frames: 16 pedal, eight jump, four spin, one shadow, and four teddy portraits, plus nine named animation sequences\n\nAll circuits are static 40x20-character worlds below the five-row HUD, so the renderer uses per-cell Color RAM without any scrolling tax. Each map has its own visual layout, block vocabulary, material plane, special-surface placement, start grid, and 16 ordered checkpoints.\n\n## Runtime composition\n\nThe game explicitly composes Web64 Motion, Collision, Animation, Direct Sprite, Actor, and World modules. The static circuit and its Color RAM are rendered only when a race begins. Ordinary race frames update four subpixel racers, ordered checkpoints, AI, material interactions, animation frames, HUD deltas, and eight hardware sprites.\n\nThe project uses Web64-native c64lib VIC-II names for hardware-facing setup. A baseline first proved the generic C composition too expensive in this compiler configuration: update 79,491 cycles, full HUD 247,399 cycles, and sprite rendering 15,638 cycles. Only then were those fixed four-racer frame operations fused in `src/race-hot.asm`; track/world construction, actor storage, animation data, collision setup, and all game flow remain in C and the Game Runtime. Racer contact pairs are distributed deterministically across frames so collision behavior remains complete without paying for all six AABB pairs in one frame.\n\n## CPU and SID budget\n\nPAL provides 19,656 CPU cycles per frame. Verification reserves 2,200 cycles for an ordinary SID player call and 3,200 cycles on the worst frame. The measured worst game frame is 8,607 cycles; with the worst SID reserve it uses 11,807 cycles and leaves 7,849 cycles free. See `PERFORMANCE.md` for reproducible evidence.\n\nEvery planned music or sound trigger is marked with a `TODO MUSIC` or `TODO SFX` comment in `main.c`. The per-frame placeholder is `sid_player_todo()`.\n\n## Build targets\n\n- **Trike Mania**: playable release game, starting at `$2d00`\n- **Trike Mania Verification**: deterministic twelve-case exercise target covering every teddy on every track, boost/jump/oil behavior, four natural checkpoint-validated finishes per race, results, and cycle markers\n- **Visual Evidence** targets: deterministic title, selection, and three-track screenshots used by the repository acceptance route\n\nThe memory plan keeps the software C stack at `$0800-$09ff`, reserves `$1000-$1fff` for the future SID, stores the charset at `$2000-$23ff`, stores 33 sprite frames at `$2400-$2c3f`, and places code at `$2d00+`. Startup selects processor-port value `$35`, exposing RAM beneath BASIC/KERNAL ROM while keeping C64 I/O visible. The generator rejects any target that would reach the C64 I/O window at `$d000`.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "PERFORMANCE.md",
      "name": "PERFORMANCE.md",
      "kind": "source",
      "source": "# Trike Mania frame budget\n\nThe generator compiles the release, verification, and visual-evidence targets before publishing this project. The dedicated verification route profiles production-equivalent race frames after initializing all four racers.\n\nBudget contract:\n\n- PAL frame: 19,656 cycles\n- Ordinary SID reserve: 2,200 cycles\n- Worst-case SID reserve: 3,200 cycles\n- Maximum game-logic/render budget on a worst frame: 16,456 cycles\n- Static map rendering, title construction, selection construction, and results construction occur outside the race-frame loop\n- Baseline generic C update: 79,491 cycles\n- Baseline full HUD: 247,399 cycles\n- Baseline direct sprite composition: 15,638 cycles\n- Fused four-racer update plus distributed contact maximum: 6,801 cycles\n- Dirty HUD writer maximum: 591 cycles\n- Eight-sprite race renderer maximum: 1,090 cycles\n- Complete measured worst game frame: 8,607 cycles\n- Worst game frame plus 3,200-cycle SID reserve: 11,807 cycles\n- Remaining PAL worst-frame headroom: 7,849 cycles\n- Bespoke assembly was accepted only after those baseline measurements demonstrated the breach\n\nAcceptance also completes one natural, ordered-checkpoint circuit with all four active racers for every teddy/track combination. A timeout fallback is present for the playable game but is forbidden by the verification target.\n\nReproduce with `npm run test:trike-mania` and `npm run test:trike-mania-visual` in the Web64 IDE repository.\n"
    }
  ]
}
